<title>SLOVAKIA: TENNIS-SLOVAKIA BEAT CANADA 5-0 IN FED CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SLOVAKIA BEAT CANADA 5-0 IN FED CUP.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia beat Canada 5-0 in their Federation Cup World Group Two regional qualifying play-off after the last singles and doubles on Sunday.</p>
<p>Sunday results (Slovak names first):</p>
<p>singles</p>
<p>Karina Habsudova beat Patricia Hy-Boulais 6-2 7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>Henrieta Nagyova beat Rene Simpson 6-0 7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>Doubles</p>
<p>Karina Habsudova/Katarina Studenikova beat Rene Simpson/ Sonya Jeyaseelan 4-6 2-0 - Canada scratched after a leg injury to Jeyaseelan.</p>
</text>
